    "type": "game",
    "name": "Medieval Frontiers",
    "steam_appid": 1207360,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/015ad751a57465c1f69d073db957aba2.avif?t=1753357152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defy the odds in this harsh and brutal environment. Scavenge resources, cook food, craft goods and prepare medicines to ensure you, and your growing community thrives. In a world of famine and hardship, of disease and death, become a hero, keeping your villagers happy and healthy, whatever the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/a8d85df94cd4ca6773cd8570dd9eb2ab.poster.avif?t=1753357152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/a8d85df94cd4ca6773cd8570dd9eb2ab.webm?t=1753357152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/c4fe175db68614c62d141b0b4a2ae84a.avif?t=1753357152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raze the forests. Clear cut the timber. Process the materials. Every resource matters. And every resource can be depleted. Manage your environments wisely, don\u2019t use today, what you may need tomorrow. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely place the layout of buildings, furniture and workbenches. Designing a village has never been more customizable. You choose where, and what to build. For the first time, you decide who occupies which dwelling. Assign your villagers tasks and housing in a fully responsive world as you seek to maximize your yields.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/7773604f9d3057d6b98e517a6bbe3ffa.poster.avif?t=1753357152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/7773604f9d3057d6b98e517a6bbe3ffa.webm?t=1753357152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/d042d329cce3f9da819ff960f35e502c.avif?t=1753357152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for lost and scattered souls in the wild, bring them into your settlement, and help them build a new life. Each person you rescue has their own traits, needs, and personality. Grow your village in your redemption quest from exile to exalted hero.\u00a0<br>Danger awaits in the many different landscapes. From the ravages of the moor, to the terrors of the forest. With everything wanting only to survive, navigate the world with caution. Brave the hardships. The higher the risk, the higher the reward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/0bdbab2481c925130840fee6aa73e2c0.poster.avif?t=1753357152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/0bdbab2481c925130840fee6aa73e2c0.webm?t=1753357152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/d2a5b56ea88b1d701a309342c4ff1e5c.avif?t=1753357152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sow the seeds, till the fields and reap the fruits of your labor. Prepare for the winter by stocking up on supplies. You have to prepare nutritious meals and craft healing medicines to keep famine and sickness at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/529d4c555afd2c5284d468481109ce07.poster.avif?t=1753357152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/529d4c555afd2c5284d468481109ce07.webm?t=1753357152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/015ad751a57465c1f69d073db957aba2.avif?t=1753357152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Defy the odds in this harsh and brutal environment. Scavenge resources, cook food, craft goods and prepare medicines to ensure you, and your growing community thrives. In a world of famine and hardship, of disease and death, become a hero, keeping your villagers happy and healthy, whatever the cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/a8d85df94cd4ca6773cd8570dd9eb2ab.poster.avif?t=1753357152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/a8d85df94cd4ca6773cd8570dd9eb2ab.webm?t=1753357152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/c4fe175db68614c62d141b0b4a2ae84a.avif?t=1753357152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raze the forests. Clear cut the timber. Process the materials. Every resource matters. And every resource can be depleted. Manage your environments wisely, don\u2019t use today, what you may need tomorrow. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Freely place the layout of buildings, furniture and workbenches. Designing a village has never been more customizable. You choose where, and what to build. For the first time, you decide who occupies which dwelling. Assign your villagers tasks and housing in a fully responsive world as you seek to maximize your yields.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/7773604f9d3057d6b98e517a6bbe3ffa.poster.avif?t=1753357152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/7773604f9d3057d6b98e517a6bbe3ffa.webm?t=1753357152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/d042d329cce3f9da819ff960f35e502c.avif?t=1753357152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Search for lost and scattered souls in the wild, bring them into your settlement, and help them build a new life. Each person you rescue has their own traits, needs, and personality. Grow your village in your redemption quest from exile to exalted hero.\u00a0<br>Danger awaits in the many different landscapes. From the ravages of the moor, to the terrors of the forest. With everything wanting only to survive, navigate the world with caution. Brave the hardships. The higher the risk, the higher the reward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/0bdbab2481c925130840fee6aa73e2c0.poster.avif?t=1753357152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/0bdbab2481c925130840fee6aa73e2c0.webm?t=1753357152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/d2a5b56ea88b1d701a309342c4ff1e5c.avif?t=1753357152\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sow the seeds, till the fields and reap the fruits of your labor. Prepare for the winter by stocking up on supplies. You have to prepare nutritious meals and craft healing medicines to keep famine and sickness at bay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/529d4c555afd2c5284d468481109ce07.poster.avif?t=1753357152\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1207360/extras/529d4c555afd2c5284d468481109ce07.webm?t=1753357152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Medieval Frontiers is a first-person village builder set in a wild and untamed medieval world. Establish your frontier settlement, manage resources, plant crops, craft items and guide your people through hard times and harsh conditions.",
